From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mproton <mproton@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:36:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] protontts: Include <limits.h> instead of <linux/limits.h>.

PATH_MAX is POSIX and comes from <limits.h> on Linux (glibc) and on
macOS; <linux/limits.h> does not exist on darwin.

mproton: darwin build blocker 5 in docs/wine-patch-triage.md.
---
 dlls/protontts/unixlib.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/protontts/unixlib.c b/dlls/protontts/unixlib.c
index 1b0fa7a9836..c47671da6eb 100644
--- a/dlls/protontts/unixlib.c
+++ b/dlls/protontts/unixlib.c
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@
 #include <unistd.h>
 #include <pthread.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
-#include <linux/limits.h>
+#include <limits.h>
 #include <sys/stat.h>
 
 #include <piper/piper_c.h>
